  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Mutant Beasts 将流行的 Mutant Creatures 模组带回现代 Minecraft，时隔四年再次更新。</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">请注意，我并非原始创作者；所有内容制作的功劳归于 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/shcott21/followers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">shcott21</a>/<a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/members/thehippomaster21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">thehippomaster21</a><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">我曾私下联系作者请求授权制作此移植版本，但作者尚未回复，这意味着我并未获得官方许可。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">原版模组需要另一个名为 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/animationapi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AnimationAPI</a> 的模组才能运行，这也是 Mutant Creatures 创作者的作品，但本模组无需使用该模组。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">以下是原版模组在 CurseForge 页面以及 Minecraft 论坛页面的链接。论坛页面包含了您了解此模组所需的大部分信息。我也是从这里获取了本项目以及游戏内模组界面的标志，这些标志的版权归其各自的创作者所有。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Minecraft Forge</span></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;如何制作化学X<br></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fthumbs.gfycat.com%252fFragrantSingleArcherfish-mobile.mp4\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://thumbs.gfycat.com/FragrantSingleArcherfish-mobile.mp4</a></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">制作蜘蛛猪</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fthumbs.gfycat.com%252fBraveAromaticAdmiralbutterfly-mobile.mp4\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://thumbs.gfycat.com/BraveAromaticAdmiralbutterfly-mobile.mp4</a></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">驯服蜘蛛猪</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fthumbs.gfycat.com%252fElderlyBadJabiru-mobile.mp4\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://thumbs.gfycat.com/ElderlyBadJabiru-mobile.mp4</a></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\">CurseForge：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-creatures-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mutant Creatures Mod </a></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\">Minecraft 论坛：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding-java-edition/minecraft-mods/1284438-mutant-creatures-spider-pig-spider-pig-v1-4-9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mutant Creatures - Spider Pig, Spider Pig [v1.4.9]</a></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><br></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
